// Link this test with fpu-reference.cpp / sonic_fpu_reference.hpp generated by
// prepare-fpu-runtime.py, plus the production FPU runtime/SDK. The candidate
// header comes from prepare-fpu-body.py. No test-only production probe or TLS.
// Compare ORIGINAL helper results after every operation, not only final values.
